#{[17592186522416 #edb/ref 1080 "109\\,440" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522416 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522416 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "c0888d94-3576-5d80-b4b7-c1a0f50ff127" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522464 #edb/ref 1080 "1\\,260" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522464 #edb/ref 1082 #edb/ref 17592186045498 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522464 #edb/ref 1083 #uuid "d7093da7-6fca-5b2f-bf9a-07216a1b922e" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522620 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186522074 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522620 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186522224 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522620 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186522244 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522620 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186522285 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522620 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186522416 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522620 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522620 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522620 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186522074 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522620 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "7e4a1ba6-7426-5a33-ab15-d55e1bd0f323" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522642 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186522238 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522642 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186522282 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522642 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186522297 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522642 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186522326 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522642 #edb/ref 1075 #edb/ref 17592186522464 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522642 #edb/ref 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522642 #edb/ref 1077 "selection" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522642 #edb/ref 1078 #edb/ref 17592186522326 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522642 #edb/ref 1079 #uuid "a1de2e92-9b96-54c1-839b-6cad9c1cd05b" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522718 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186522620 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522718 #edb/ref 1069 "q-122214" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522718 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522718 #edb/ref 1071 "${}_{20}{P}_{5}=$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522718 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "3cd87003-8b3d-5e51-bfe0-aa7c92e7f7e1" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522718 #edb/ref 1074 "The formula for ${}_{n}{P}_{r}$ is given by\n\n$$\n{}_{n}{P}_{r}=\\frac{n!}{(n-r)!}\\,.\n$$\n\nSubstituting $n=20$ and $r=5$ into the above, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{}_{20}{P}_{5} & =\\frac{20!}{(20-5)!} \\\\  & =\\frac{20!}{15!} \\\\  & =\\frac{20\\cdot 19\\cdot 18\\cdot 17\\cdot 16\\cdot \\cancel{15!}}{\\cancel{15!}} \\\\  & =20\\cdot 19\\cdot 18\\cdot 17\\cdot 16 \\\\  & =1\\,860\\,480.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522750 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186522642 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522750 #edb/ref 1069 "q-122230" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522750 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522750 #edb/ref 1071 "A cook designs a menu for his restaurant from Thursday to Sunday. Each day, only one main dish will be served, and it will not be repeated on any other day. If the cook wants to choose from the $9$ most popular dishes, how many different menus can the cook design?" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522750 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "859b5680-eb9f-5faf-a3e0-6d7891dc3557" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186522750 #edb/ref 1074 "The number of permutations of $n$ objects taken $r$ at a time is given by the formula\n\n$$\n{}_{n}{P}_{r}=\\frac{n!}{(n-r)!}.\n$$\n\nThere are $9$ popular dishes to choose from, so $n=9.$ We want to select $4$ of those for the menu, one for each day (Thursday, Friday, Saturday, and Sunday), so we have $r=4.$ \n\nTherefore, the number of different choices is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{}_{9}{P}_{4} & =\\frac{9!}{(9-4)!} \\\\  & =\\frac{9!}{5!} \\\\  & =\\frac{9\\cdot 8\\cdot 7\\cdot 6\\cdot \\cancel{5!}}{\\cancel{5!}} \\\\  & =9\\cdot 8\\cdot 7\\cdot 6 \\\\  & =3\\,024.\\end{aligned}\n$$" #edb/ref 17592186045417]}
